# tests/unattended-sysctl-path.bats DELISTED 2026-08-23 — same SHRINK direction, and its seeded
# measurement turns out to name the cure exactly. Admitted on run 31362043861 at notok=2; the cause
# was found and fixed in "fix(tests): two cases needed the box to be BUSY to pass, and the filed
# cause said the opposite" (item 6a82c9405b9e). Its two qos-census cases invoked the real
# scripts/qos-census.sh as a bare out="$(...)", so bats' errexit consumed that script's four-state
# VERDICT rc (0 PASS / 1 FAIL / 3 NO-BURST / 4 SIGNAL-DEAD) as if it were a health signal. A runner
# is by definition quiet, so the verdict there is always NO-BURST — rc 3 — and the two cases could
# not pass off-box BY CONSTRUCTION. That is what notok=2 was: not a machine-coupling, an inverted
# test. A/B on the identical runner (scripts/offbox-run.sh suites, the one CI uses), pre-fix blob
# swapped in place: RED 7 ok / 2 notok -> GREEN 10 ok / 0 notok. A named mechanism PLUS a census
# green is the whole bar, and the land's own ratchet arm re-measured it green independently.
# tests/watchdog-census.bats DELISTED 2026-08-15 — the SHRINK direction this file declares itself
# subject to ("RE-MEASURED, NOT CURATED"). Admitted on run 31362043861 at notok=1; the cause was
# then found and fixed in 30494ba09 (a death-path bound rule that guarded the bug it was written
# beside). CENSUS run 31909362400 — the arm that exists to re-measure an exclusion in this
# direction — ran it at 20 ok / 0 notok / 4s. A named mechanism PLUS a census green is the whole
# bar, so the line goes rather than ageing into a permanent exemption nobody re-checks.

